{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dolven is a narrative-driven tactical RPG where combat fuses party-based skills with poker-style card combos and deckbuilding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark fantasy world, you command a band of mercenaries against the Dungeon Master who rules each cursed dungeon. Battles unfold on a grid-based battlefield where positioning, timing, and strategy are as important as the hand of fate you hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/40415567a9d886426ee794057f2946da.avif?t=1762251630\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A First-of-Its-Kind Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of <i>Dolven</i> lies a unique blend of classic RPG combat and poker-inspired deckbuilding.<br>Your mercenaries wield swords, bows, and spells through traditional RPG abilities with additional buffs coming from the cards in your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form poker-style combinations called a 'Rune Combo' such as pairs, straights, and flushes to earn extra mana with which to unlock more cards, empowering your party to turn the tide of battle. Every duel is more than a clash of steel\u2014it\u2019s a contest against the Dungeon Master himself, with you as his opponent, that's two dungeon masters facing off.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/c7f13f06124a5123e8545aa9cb180bfa.avif?t=1762251630\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dark Fantasy Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dolven</i> is more than a dungeon crawl. It is a battle against the Dungeon Master, a struggle against fate, and a journey into the heart of a dark fantasy curse in the search for a missing girl.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Stronghold</strong>, the werewolf <strong>Witherfang</strong>\u00a0hides a chilling secret...and a missing child.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Freewood Forest</strong>, twisted fairytale creatures obey the cruel will of <strong>Atrisia Ven</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the icy peaks, you\u2019ll face <strong>Drulk the Ogre</strong> and his band of brutish misfits\u2014watch out, he\u2019s hungering for fresh meat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you survive these trials, your path will lead you to <strong>Yongul</strong>, a figure cloaked in power and secrets. He is not what he seems\u2014and when his truth is revealed, you must decide what fate awaits Dolven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you break the curse, or be consumed by it?<br>Will you find the girl\u2014or lose her to the darkness?<br>Will you honor your oath\u2014or betray it for a greater cause?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice will be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ed391e5aaa5bb7710013dd82e82aaaeb.avif?t=1762251630\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices That Shape Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six distinct endings\u2014and a final, hidden reckoning only the bold will uncover\u2014<i>Dolven</i> is a tale of loyalty and betrayal, of curses and crowns, and of the impossible choices that decide whether darkness endures\u2026 or is finally broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/b367267680981f1287cef75c08c37702.avif?t=1762251630\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deckbuilding &amp; Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players construct a deck made up of two main card types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenary Cards</strong> \u2013 Summon warriors, rogues, and mages to the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Cards</strong> \u2013 Cast magical effects, buffs, debuffs, or alter the battlefield itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card belongs to one of three archetypes\u2014<strong>Strength (Red), Dexterity (Green), or Intelligence (Blue).</strong><br>Arrange Mercenary cards on the Pillars to form hands like pairs, flushes, or straight flushes. The in-game Compendium lists every possible combo and the rewards they bring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you battle through Dolven\u2019s maze of dungeons, you\u2019ll customize your deck and collect gear to prepare for deadlier enemies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.poster.avif?t=1762251630\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.webm?t=1762251630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.mp4?t=1762251630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical RPG Combat</strong> \u2013 Command your party on a grid-based battlefield, combining movement, positioning, and class abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poker-Style Card Combos</strong> \u2013 Form hands like pairs, straights, and flushes to unleash explosive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Master Duels</strong> \u2013 Each dungeon is ruled by a powerful Dungeon Master who fights back, shaping the battlefield against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Narrative</strong> \u2013 Unravel the necromancer\u2019s curse through quests steeped in lore, prophecy, and choice-driven outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Customization</strong> \u2013 Build your deck, recruit mercenaries across three archetypes, and tailor your strategy to the enemies ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.poster.avif?t=1762251630\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.webm?t=1762251630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.mp4?t=1762251630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Dungeon Master invites you to a Dual, the Quest Begins Now!\u00a0 Who will stand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rune Pair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2369850/69298106e5d51eec04b1805467d9e7e60b56702a.jpg"},{"name":"Dual Rune Pair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2369850/e1226e1c746d5b925648f6aa7e7491b1b23d13a3.jpg"},{"name":"Rune Triad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcomm